        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyū gwene mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA ūyo gūkang'wizīīla Mika muna Moleshesi mu makanza ga būsugi wa batemi ba mu sī ya Yuda; ba Yotamu, Ahazi na Hezekia. Shalī shakoolechiwa īsho akashibona kūlwa mihayo ya Samalia na Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MIC.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MIC.1.1"
            ]
